    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "by Hiraki Corale, Hylotl adventurer\nMy ship crash-landed on a planet. I may have been fleeing a certain simian species at the time, and decided the best course of action was to lure them into an asteroid field. It worked! Of course, I have no experience navigating through asteroid fields so here I am.",
    "value": "由鲛人探险家 平木·圣咏 所著\n我的飞船在一颗星球上迫降了。当时我可能正在躲避某种猿人，觉得最佳对策是把他们引到小行星带里。结果嘛，奏效了！当然，我本人毫无穿越小行星带的经验，所以就落到这步田地咯。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "I found a group of humans in a hole in the ground. Not the creepy kind of hole, some kind of military bunker. I thought I'd drop in, regale them with tales of some of my adventures, but no, they were having none of it. Wouldn't even let me in. Shocking hospitality! In the end I borrowed one of their spaceships for spare parts, and left them to it.",
    "value": "我在地上发现了一个洞，里面有一群人类。不是那种天然的洞，是某种军事地堡。我本想进去逛逛，跟他们讲讲我的一些冒险故事，可他们压根不买账。连门都不让我进！这待客之道可真够呛！最后呢，我“借”走了他们一艘飞船上的几个零件，然后就随他们去了。"
  }
